<title>JAPAN: Japan PM says yen weakness not excessive - Jiji.</title>
<headline>Japan PM says yen weakness not excessive - Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto was quoted by Jiji news agency as saying on Tuesday that he does not think the yen's recent weakness is excessive.</p>
<p>He made the remarks to reporters after Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka told a news conference earlier on Tuesday that the yen's recent weakness is excessive.</p>
</text>
